    "description": {
      "value": "<p>(14th Level) You temporarily suspend divine or pseudo-divine authority.</p><p><strong>Noise:</strong> +1</p><p>Choose a target manifesting power granted by:</p><ul><li><p>A god</p></li><li><p>A thoughtform</p></li><li><p>A divine contract</p></li><li><p>A metaphysical mandate</p></li></ul><p>You may suppress those granted abilities temporarily.</p><h3>Cost</h3><p>Spend 1–2 Surge (scale by magnitude of divinity).</p><h3>Effect</h3><ul><li><p>Divine abilities fail or become inert.</p></li><li><p>The source may resist (GM adjudicated).</p></li></ul><h3>Pushback</h3><p>This always generates backlash. Always.</p><p>Divine counter-investigations, mandate challenges, celestial scrutiny.</p><p></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
